---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy · LandControl" description="Privacy policy for landcontrol.co.uk." noindex={true}>
<header class="wrap hero"><div class="grid"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">LandControl</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--red)">Privacy policy</span></p><h1>Privacy policy.</h1><p class="lede">Last updated 27 October 2026. Questions: contact@landcontrol.co.uk.</p></div></header>
<section class="wrap band"><div class="grid"><div class="body">
<h3>Who we are</h3><p>LandControl ("we") operates landcontrol.co.uk. We are the data controller for personal data collected through this site. Contact: contact@landcontrol.co.uk.</p>
<h3>What we collect</h3><p>If you subscribe to the Contractual Control Alert we collect your email address and, if you tell us, your professional role. If you buy a product we receive your name, email and billing details from our payment provider, Stripe, which handles card data; we never see your card number. We collect standard server logs and aggregate analytics to understand how the site is used.</p>
<h3>Why, and on what basis</h3><p>To send you the alerts you asked for (consent, which you can withdraw at any time via the unsubscribe link); to provide products you have bought (contract); to keep the site secure and improve it (legitimate interests).</p>
<h3>Who we share it with</h3><p>Our email provider, payment provider (Stripe), hosting provider (Vercel) and analytics provider, each acting as a processor under contract. We do not sell personal data.</p>
<h3>How long we keep it</h3><p>Alert subscriptions until you unsubscribe. Customer records for six years after the last transaction, for accounting purposes. Logs for 90 days.</p>
<h3>Your rights</h3><p>You can ask for a copy of your data, ask us to correct or delete it, object to processing, or complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk). Email contact@landcontrol.co.uk.</p>
<h3>Cookies</h3><p>We use only cookies that are strictly necessary for the site to work and, where you have consented, analytics cookies. Browser storage is used to remember preferences on this device only.</p>

</div></div></section>
</Base>
